<title>USA: Equity Residential, Wellsford close merger.</title>
<headline>Equity Residential, Wellsford close merger.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equity Residential Properties Trust said Friday it completed its merger with Wellsford Residential Property Trust.</p>
<p>Each Wellsford common share was exchanged for 0.625 Equity Residential share and 0.25 share of Wellsford Real Properties Inc, a company that will continue Wellford's development activities.</p>
<p>Equity Residential said it issued 10.8 million new common shares and assumed Wellsford's outstanding liabilities of $370 million and $158 million in preferred shares.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
